1
00:00:07,745 --> 00:00:09,025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,145 --> 00:01:42,585
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:01:46,145 --> 00:01:51,945
THE GREAT BORDER GATE

4
00:01:55,505 --> 00:01:58,105
The… The Lord of Xiaonan rebelled.

5
00:02:02,105 --> 00:02:03,945
Return at once to tell Her Highness.

6
00:02:05,665 --> 00:02:07,625
Your Highness, Xiao Xun
killed the dispatch riders.

7
00:02:08,144 --> 00:02:09,625
We've lost contact with the Capital.

8
00:02:10,304 --> 00:02:12,825
All post houses along the way
are under his control.

9
00:02:13,425 --> 00:02:14,945
Rumors reached the Capital.

10
00:02:15,025 --> 00:02:15,905
Northern Desert Army
breached Bailang Pass.

11
00:02:16,785 --> 00:02:17,945
Yunzhong will fall in three days.

12
00:02:18,465 --> 00:02:20,705
They'll march for the imperial city.

13
00:02:22,785 --> 00:02:23,705
How's the Capital?

14
00:02:24,385 --> 00:02:25,825
Fifty thousand troops in the capital camp

15
00:02:25,905 --> 00:02:27,545
and one 100,000 nearby.
Why should we fear Xiao Xun?

16
00:02:28,225 --> 00:02:29,905
What we fear is that the commoners

17
00:02:29,985 --> 00:02:32,505
believe Xiao Xun's lie
to defend the Capital.

18
00:02:33,145 --> 00:02:34,225
In that case,

19
00:02:34,305 --> 00:02:36,425
he can rightfully
lead his troops into the city.

20
00:02:37,545 --> 00:02:39,105
If Xiao Xun enters the Capital,

21
00:02:39,905 --> 00:02:41,505
Yu's life will be in danger.

22
00:02:42,225 --> 00:02:43,625
Xie Yanfang is by Yu's side.

23
00:02:44,745 --> 00:02:45,665
He's ruthless.

24
00:02:46,945 --> 00:02:48,585
But his clan relies on Yu.

25
00:02:49,305 --> 00:02:50,705
Xie Yanfang will protect him.

26
00:02:52,385 --> 00:02:53,425
You're right.

27
00:02:54,105 --> 00:02:57,105
Xie Yanfang still has a crucial trick.

28
00:02:57,185 --> 00:02:58,505
This time,

29
00:02:59,465 --> 00:03:00,985
he'll definitely make this move.

30
00:03:02,505 --> 00:03:03,345
Get Xiaoman to me.

31
00:03:04,185 --> 00:03:05,025
Yes.

32
00:03:26,145 --> 00:03:27,505
CHU ZHAO

33
00:03:40,225 --> 00:03:42,865
Whatever you want me to do, let me know.

34
00:03:42,945 --> 00:03:45,545
All post houses along the way
have been cut off.

35
00:03:45,625 --> 00:03:47,425
I want you to take your men

36
00:03:47,505 --> 00:03:49,625
to bypass the post houses
and head for the Capital.

37
00:03:49,705 --> 00:03:52,785
Then, escort my cousin Chu Tang
and her family out of the Capital.

38
00:03:53,745 --> 00:03:55,025
Why all the trouble?

39
00:03:55,105 --> 00:03:57,865
Why don't we let her bring the news
of the frontier to the Capital?

40
00:03:57,945 --> 00:04:00,265
Who would believe a bandit?

41
00:04:01,625 --> 00:04:02,945
The public opinion in the Capital

42
00:04:03,025 --> 00:04:05,745
completely favors Xiao Xun,
who "guards" His Majesty.

43
00:04:08,105 --> 00:04:10,065
Then what is the problem
with Chu Tang's family?

44
00:04:10,665 --> 00:04:11,985
Chu Lan is a mere civil official.

45
00:04:12,065 --> 00:04:14,865
What danger justifies
all the effort to save him?

46
00:04:14,945 --> 00:04:16,065
In the Anping Rebellion,

47
00:04:16,145 --> 00:04:19,145
Xiao Xun used my uncle
to kill His Majesty.

48
00:04:19,225 --> 00:04:20,745
Now, he's the key witness.

49
00:04:20,825 --> 00:04:22,145
All parties will fight over him.

50
00:04:23,705 --> 00:04:24,545
I count on you.

51
00:04:25,345 --> 00:04:26,465
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

52
00:04:31,865 --> 00:04:34,065
What about you? To the Capital?

53
00:04:35,145 --> 00:04:36,065
No.

54
00:04:40,025 --> 00:04:41,865
I'm going somewhere else.

55
00:04:45,265 --> 00:04:47,105
TABLET OF LATE FATHER, CHU LING

56
00:04:47,185 --> 00:04:49,145
TABLET OF LATE MOTHER, MU MIANHONG

57
00:04:50,945 --> 00:04:52,025
Father.

58
00:04:53,025 --> 00:04:53,945
Mother.

59
00:04:55,145 --> 00:04:56,865
You were separated half your lives.

60
00:04:57,585 --> 00:05:01,825
Now you're finally reunited
in the underworld.

61
00:05:03,025 --> 00:05:04,025
Sadly,

62
00:05:06,185 --> 00:05:07,505
I have to leave.

63
00:05:08,825 --> 00:05:10,665
I'll keep defending the city

64
00:05:11,905 --> 00:05:13,145
Father left undefended.

65
00:05:15,225 --> 00:05:16,785
I'll continue the war

66
00:05:18,145 --> 00:05:19,305
Father left unfinished.

67
00:05:21,305 --> 00:05:24,105
Mother dreamed of peace
all over the world.

68
00:05:26,065 --> 00:05:27,625
I'll make it come true.

69
00:05:50,465 --> 00:05:52,745
THE CAPITAL

70
00:05:53,865 --> 00:05:56,665
I've heard Xiao Xun
has reached Baili Pavilion.

71
00:05:56,745 --> 00:05:59,465
A noble heir like him is always reliable.

72
00:05:59,545 --> 00:06:01,865
I believe soon, he'll rescue
the Capital from danger.

73
00:06:02,945 --> 00:06:04,505
He's been practicing martial arts
since childhood,

74
00:06:04,585 --> 00:06:05,985
and he leads elite troops.

75
00:06:06,065 --> 00:06:08,545
I hope he'll arrive soon.

76
00:06:09,305 --> 00:06:11,025
Since General Chu died,

77
00:06:11,105 --> 00:06:13,025
the Yunzhong troops
have been in utter chaos.

78
00:06:13,625 --> 00:06:15,825
They won't bother with the Capital.

79
00:06:15,905 --> 00:06:18,145
Luckily, His Highness is on his way here.

80
00:06:18,225 --> 00:06:19,825
Fair enough.

81
00:06:20,465 --> 00:06:24,105
The Grand Princess is brave,
but she's too young.

82
00:06:24,705 --> 00:06:26,545
We have to count on real royal members

83
00:06:27,145 --> 00:06:30,305
to guard the Capital
and protect our state.

84
00:06:32,585 --> 00:06:34,585
Jiang, the weather is lovely.

85
00:06:34,665 --> 00:06:36,305
Take Tang out for some fresh air.

86
00:06:36,985 --> 00:06:38,705
The tea has gone cold.

87
00:06:38,785 --> 00:06:39,865
The conversation is ironic.

88
00:06:40,465 --> 00:06:42,785
If she stays longer, she'll feel sick.

89
00:06:45,505 --> 00:06:47,025
Goodbye, then.

90
00:06:47,545 --> 00:06:48,385
Jiang.

91
00:06:49,785 --> 00:06:50,985
Why is she angry again?

92
00:06:55,545 --> 00:06:57,545
Mr. Xiao Xun is noble.

93
00:06:58,225 --> 00:07:01,065
Had General Chu not built
the city walls at great cost…

94
00:07:01,705 --> 00:07:03,025
Had Her Highness not guarded Wangcheng…

95
00:07:03,745 --> 00:07:04,945
You couldn't be sitting here,

96
00:07:05,585 --> 00:07:07,665
enjoying cold tea, or satirizing them.

97
00:07:08,745 --> 00:07:10,625
I advise you to hold your tongues.

98
00:07:18,305 --> 00:07:21,105
Jiang, I have a favor to ask.

99
00:07:21,705 --> 00:07:24,145
We're friends. Don't say that. What is it?

100
00:07:25,065 --> 00:07:26,705
I need help from your family.

101
00:07:30,145 --> 00:07:33,665
Mr. Xie, to what do I owe
the honor of this visit?

102
00:07:40,425 --> 00:07:42,345
I'm here to ask you, Mr. Deng.

103
00:07:43,905 --> 00:07:45,945
Do you really choose

104
00:07:47,825 --> 00:07:49,025
to throw your life away with Xiao Xun?

105
00:07:53,945 --> 00:07:55,265
What do you mean?

106
00:07:56,065 --> 00:07:58,265
I don't understand.

107
00:08:00,865 --> 00:08:02,905
Xiao Xun has reached Baili Pavilion.

108
00:08:02,985 --> 00:08:06,505
He keeps releasing messages
that he's coming to protect His Majesty.

109
00:08:07,225 --> 00:08:10,545
He expects a wide-open city gate
where people line up to welcome him.

110
00:08:10,625 --> 00:08:15,705
But do you know how we will end up

111
00:08:16,345 --> 00:08:17,945
if the city gate is open to him?

112
00:08:18,745 --> 00:08:20,265
Since it's the will of people,

113
00:08:20,785 --> 00:08:23,145
you should try to stop
the people in the Capital.

114
00:08:23,825 --> 00:08:27,425
What's the point of coming here
to stop me?

115
00:08:29,385 --> 00:08:30,825
Looks like you're determined

116
00:08:31,945 --> 00:08:33,305
to side with Mr. Xiao.

117
00:08:33,904 --> 00:08:35,865
They're within the defense line.

118
00:08:36,385 --> 00:08:37,904
The Capital is just ahead.

119
00:08:38,425 --> 00:08:40,505
If His Majesty still refuses
to open the gate,

120
00:08:41,225 --> 00:08:43,985
their advance will be an unauthorized move
and willful treason.

121
00:08:44,905 --> 00:08:46,505
After they enter the city,

122
00:08:46,585 --> 00:08:49,705
you might as well
find an excuse to kill them.

123
00:08:50,545 --> 00:08:52,705
You know people's will is irreversible.

124
00:08:53,425 --> 00:08:56,145
In their eyes, Xiao Xun

125
00:08:56,745 --> 00:08:59,145
is a meritorious protector
they're expecting.

126
00:09:00,225 --> 00:09:01,865
If His Majesty still refuses,

127
00:09:01,945 --> 00:09:03,905
people will complain.

128
00:09:03,985 --> 00:09:07,425
So, Mr. Xie, what do you intend to do?

129
00:09:12,865 --> 00:09:14,545
We must make Xiao Xun

130
00:09:15,265 --> 00:09:17,585
a rebel again.

131
00:09:17,665 --> 00:09:22,465
Are you saying
you'll prove his father's treason?

132
00:09:22,545 --> 00:09:23,465
Only in this way

133
00:09:24,065 --> 00:09:26,265
can we stop Xiao Xun from entering town.

134
00:09:26,345 --> 00:09:28,025
If he attacks by force,

135
00:09:28,105 --> 00:09:29,945
all the people will know

136
00:09:30,025 --> 00:09:32,545
that the court has no choice
but to fight back.

137
00:09:33,265 --> 00:09:38,345
If war breaks out,
the court will be rightful.

138
00:09:38,865 --> 00:09:40,945
We'll have no more worries,

139
00:09:41,025 --> 00:09:43,025
and all the people will submit.

140
00:09:44,065 --> 00:09:45,665
Then no one will question

141
00:09:47,425 --> 00:09:48,905
Yu's throne.

142
00:09:49,705 --> 00:09:52,625
Then how will you prove
the treason of the Lord of Xiaonan?

143
00:09:53,145 --> 00:09:54,385
Do you know

144
00:09:55,065 --> 00:10:01,065
Chu Lan was bribed by Xiao Xun
to poison Yu in Chu Mansion?

145
00:10:01,145 --> 00:10:02,865
You'll use Chu Lan as a scapegoat?

146
00:10:04,105 --> 00:10:05,185
Have you considered?

147
00:10:05,785 --> 00:10:09,185
If Chu Lan gets in trouble,
the Chu Family will be implicated.

148
00:10:09,785 --> 00:10:12,105
Then the Grand Princess
can hardly stay out of trouble.

149
00:10:13,145 --> 00:10:16,625
Great achievements
require great sacrifices.

150
00:10:17,745 --> 00:10:19,985
Only when we expose Xiao Xun's scheme

151
00:10:20,905 --> 00:10:22,225
can the two of us

152
00:10:23,385 --> 00:10:26,545
keep the city gate firmly shut.

153
00:10:27,305 --> 00:10:28,225
Isn't that so?

154
00:10:30,225 --> 00:10:31,985
I'm still curious about one thing.

155
00:10:33,185 --> 00:10:35,465
Xiao Xun wrote a letter to you.

156
00:10:35,985 --> 00:10:37,065
What was in…?

157
00:10:51,825 --> 00:10:55,105
After all that talking, I finally get it.

158
00:10:55,785 --> 00:10:57,305
You think Chu Lan isn't enough.

159
00:10:57,385 --> 00:10:59,465
You'll also get me involved

160
00:11:00,385 --> 00:11:02,345
to prove their treason.

161
00:11:03,985 --> 00:11:05,745
But have you thought about this?

162
00:11:05,825 --> 00:11:07,585
Is it a righteous war?

163
00:11:07,665 --> 00:11:09,425
Is it justified?

164
00:11:09,505 --> 00:11:11,345
You care. His Majesty cares.

165
00:11:12,905 --> 00:11:13,785
But I don't care.

166
00:11:16,185 --> 00:11:19,985
Don't try to keep your clan innocent
by ruining my reputation.

167
00:11:27,625 --> 00:11:28,745
You're wrong again.

168
00:11:30,345 --> 00:11:32,865
I just came here to give you a favor.

169
00:11:35,065 --> 00:11:36,785
Instead of keeping some secrets buried,

170
00:11:39,465 --> 00:11:41,625
why not turn them into your achievements?

171
00:11:53,145 --> 00:11:53,985
My Lord.

172
00:12:02,665 --> 00:12:05,145
Xie Yanfang wants to kill two birds
with one stone.

173
00:12:14,705 --> 00:12:16,665
TO OPEN THE GATE OR NOT

174
00:12:22,345 --> 00:12:25,265
Get ready. I'll see Chu Lan tonight.

175
00:12:26,025 --> 00:12:28,585
CHU MANSION

176
00:12:37,465 --> 00:12:39,985
My Lord, we looked everywhere.
No one is in.

177
00:12:42,185 --> 00:12:45,665
We asked the neighbors.
Nothing unusual was noticed.

178
00:12:45,745 --> 00:12:49,185
During the day, Chu Tang
even had tea with some ladies.

179
00:12:49,265 --> 00:12:51,345
As she came home,
she vanished into thin air.

180
00:12:52,025 --> 00:12:53,545
We may have early plans,

181
00:12:54,105 --> 00:12:55,905
but someone's always earlier.

182
00:12:55,985 --> 00:12:57,985
As soon as we had the idea,

183
00:12:58,785 --> 00:13:00,425
they had run away.

184
00:13:01,025 --> 00:13:02,345
How could they leave so perfectly?

185
00:13:02,425 --> 00:13:05,785
Theoretically, when Chu Zhao is away,

186
00:13:05,865 --> 00:13:08,985
Chu Lan should be isolated from the court.

187
00:13:09,745 --> 00:13:11,865
And Chu Lan doesn't look
like he can read the situation.

188
00:13:12,585 --> 00:13:16,105
Is it possible
that Her Highness sent them a message?

189
00:13:16,905 --> 00:13:18,705
Xiao Xun intercepted all the messages.

190
00:13:19,705 --> 00:13:21,745
How did Chu Zhao manage to send one?

191
00:13:28,865 --> 00:13:31,785
Xie Yanfang used up all his schemes.

192
00:13:31,865 --> 00:13:34,665
But his own ally stabbed him in the back.

193
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:38,465
Send a message to Mr. Xie.

194
00:13:39,185 --> 00:13:41,585
Tell him the witness he longs for

195
00:13:44,385 --> 00:13:46,505
has fled.

196
00:13:46,585 --> 00:13:47,665
XIE RESIDENCE

197
00:13:47,745 --> 00:13:49,065
How come he fled?

198
00:13:49,585 --> 00:13:51,625
The Grand Princess

199
00:13:52,785 --> 00:13:55,745
has more political support
than I imagined.

200
00:13:55,825 --> 00:13:58,145
Of the clans that have ties
with the Chu Family,

201
00:13:58,225 --> 00:13:59,745
five left the city yesterday.

202
00:14:00,465 --> 00:14:02,865
Some said they went to rural houses.

203
00:14:02,945 --> 00:14:05,265
Some said they had an outing. And…

204
00:14:05,345 --> 00:14:07,625
Today, three ladies
met with Chu Tang in the day.

205
00:14:08,145 --> 00:14:09,425
Shall we pursue them?

206
00:14:13,225 --> 00:14:15,305
QI HONGYE EXCELS AT POLITICAL STRATEGY.
ZHOU MINGLI DEVOTES TO BE A SCHOLAR.

207
00:14:15,905 --> 00:14:17,505
It is time for us

208
00:14:19,785 --> 00:14:21,265
to go out and visit someone.

209
00:14:23,265 --> 00:14:26,265
ZHOU FAMILY’S FARMSTEAD

210
00:14:26,345 --> 00:14:32,585
‎ZHOU RESIDENCE

211
00:14:45,665 --> 00:14:46,585
Be careful, Mr. Chu.

212
00:14:46,665 --> 00:14:47,945
Come on, sweetheart.

213
00:14:51,625 --> 00:14:52,945
Hurry. Come, Tang.

214
00:14:59,705 --> 00:15:00,985
Jiang,

215
00:15:01,665 --> 00:15:03,585
-thank you.
-My pleasure.

216
00:15:04,425 --> 00:15:05,945
Don't thank me.

217
00:15:06,025 --> 00:15:08,785
Without my grandfather's approval,
I couldn't have helped you,

218
00:15:09,465 --> 00:15:10,425
even if I wanted to.

219
00:15:11,145 --> 00:15:12,905
Jiang, I need you

220
00:15:13,505 --> 00:15:14,825
to help my family leave.

221
00:15:14,905 --> 00:15:15,785
Why me?

222
00:15:15,865 --> 00:15:18,705
Shouldn't you beg some clan heads?

223
00:15:19,745 --> 00:15:21,225
I was told to ask them,

224
00:15:21,745 --> 00:15:23,105
but big clans have deep connections

225
00:15:23,185 --> 00:15:24,345
with shared interests.

226
00:15:25,105 --> 00:15:25,945
I…

227
00:15:27,025 --> 00:15:27,865
I thought about it.

228
00:15:28,745 --> 00:15:29,585
You're the only one

229
00:15:30,185 --> 00:15:31,625
I can entrust my life to.

230
00:15:33,065 --> 00:15:34,145
At the Hai hour tonight,

231
00:15:34,225 --> 00:15:37,105
my carriage will pick you up
at the back door of Chu Mansion.

232
00:15:38,105 --> 00:15:39,225
I shall remember

233
00:15:40,785 --> 00:15:42,865
your great favor.

234
00:15:44,865 --> 00:15:45,905
Go get some rest.

235
00:16:00,785 --> 00:16:02,025
Come on, Tang.

236
00:16:02,105 --> 00:16:04,225
Your uncle and his daughter
are so useless.

237
00:16:04,305 --> 00:16:06,945
We shouldn't have
expected them to bring glory.

238
00:16:08,025 --> 00:16:08,945
You…

239
00:16:10,545 --> 00:16:14,465
Luckily, our daughter is farsighted
and gets along with other noble ladies.

240
00:16:15,545 --> 00:16:17,585
Madam, you sound so proud.

241
00:16:18,705 --> 00:16:19,745
Do you really think

242
00:16:19,825 --> 00:16:22,705
her mere friendship
can get you through the city defense?

243
00:16:23,585 --> 00:16:25,545
The Grand Princess
arranged deceptive schemes

244
00:16:25,625 --> 00:16:27,585
and sent bandits to clear enemy sentries.

245
00:16:28,305 --> 00:16:30,945
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have come here alive.

246
00:16:31,025 --> 00:16:33,465
-You… You are…
-Yes.

247
00:16:34,065 --> 00:16:37,345
We're the bandits
whom people like you despise most.

248
00:16:42,865 --> 00:16:44,425
Her Highness sent me to get you.
Don't yell.

249
00:16:45,185 --> 00:16:46,625
Nod, and I'll let you go.

250
00:16:57,545 --> 00:17:01,225
<i>The Lord of Xiaonan isn't a defender,</i>
<i>but a usurper.</i>

251
00:17:01,865 --> 00:17:03,825
<i>To reveal Xiao Xun's true colors,</i>

252
00:17:03,905 --> 00:17:05,424
<i>the court will dig up the evidence</i>

253
00:17:05,505 --> 00:17:07,585
<i>your father nearly killed</i>
<i>the young emperor.</i>

254
00:17:08,224 --> 00:17:09,145
<i>Danger.</i>

255
00:17:11,025 --> 00:17:13,745
Her Highness said the heads
of these clans are reliable.

256
00:17:13,825 --> 00:17:14,665
Go ask them for help.

257
00:17:18,665 --> 00:17:20,385
CHU ZHAO

258
00:17:20,464 --> 00:17:22,944
-Darling.
-Xiaoman, let's leave.

259
00:17:23,464 --> 00:17:24,825
This is a bestowal to Jiang's ancestors.

260
00:17:25,505 --> 00:17:26,785
It must be on record
with the Ministry of War.

261
00:17:27,785 --> 00:17:28,625
Within half a day,

262
00:17:29,225 --> 00:17:30,665
we will all get caught.

263
00:17:31,665 --> 00:17:35,025
Tang, how could you
still doubt the Zhou Family?

264
00:17:35,105 --> 00:17:37,945
Just now, Miss Zhou seemed
she truly wanted to help us.

265
00:17:38,025 --> 00:17:41,265
Father, Jiang truly wants to help us.

266
00:17:41,785 --> 00:17:44,385
That's why we can't get her involved.

267
00:17:44,465 --> 00:17:46,025
-But they--
-Stop lingering.

268
00:17:46,105 --> 00:17:46,985
Go with me.

269
00:17:48,265 --> 00:17:49,865
-Let's go. Hurry.
-But they…

270
00:17:49,945 --> 00:17:50,785
Oh, darling.

271
00:18:21,905 --> 00:18:23,905
‎ZHOU BING, MINISTER OF CEREMONIES OF CHU

272
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:27,625
My Lord, Chu Lan's trail is gone.

273
00:18:40,585 --> 00:18:43,385
Mr. Zhou, you really made
very cunning moves.

274
00:18:49,065 --> 00:18:49,985
No offense,

275
00:18:52,505 --> 00:18:54,385
but I gave up a piece to get ahead.

276
00:18:59,585 --> 00:19:00,425
Mr. Xie,

277
00:19:00,505 --> 00:19:03,745
you're still so enigmatic
when playing Liubo.

278
00:19:07,265 --> 00:19:13,065
I wonder what you're fighting for
in this round.

279
00:19:18,145 --> 00:19:19,905
When the Lord of Xuan played with me,

280
00:19:21,065 --> 00:19:23,505
he wrongfully killed
a loyal man over one piece.

281
00:19:24,345 --> 00:19:25,345
In today's game,

282
00:19:26,505 --> 00:19:28,505
I'm fighting for His Majesty's life.

283
00:19:38,665 --> 00:19:39,905
The Lord of Xiaonan and his heir

284
00:19:39,985 --> 00:19:42,305
nearly took His Majesty's life.

285
00:19:43,305 --> 00:19:44,745
Chu Lan is the witness.

286
00:19:45,345 --> 00:19:50,305
So, I hope you will help His Majesty
to reveal the truth to people.

287
00:20:04,865 --> 00:20:08,265
Over generations, my clan
has been a bystander.

288
00:20:08,345 --> 00:20:11,545
Mr. Xie, you don't need
to probe me like this.

289
00:20:12,425 --> 00:20:16,345
I don't know where Chu Lan is.

290
00:20:22,105 --> 00:20:23,065
Mr. Zhou,

291
00:20:24,385 --> 00:20:26,425
you must know no one can be

292
00:20:27,545 --> 00:20:30,105
a bystander in chaotic times.

293
00:20:32,065 --> 00:20:34,025
My Lord, we've searched. Nothing.

294
00:20:35,625 --> 00:20:36,465
Yes.

295
00:20:40,265 --> 00:20:41,345
Sorry for the offense.

296
00:20:42,025 --> 00:20:43,425
I'll take my leave.

297
00:20:45,585 --> 00:20:46,465
Oh.

298
00:20:48,105 --> 00:20:49,425
It's too windy tonight.

299
00:20:50,665 --> 00:20:52,385
Remember to close your windows.

300
00:20:55,745 --> 00:20:58,465
Mr. Xie, please see yourself out.

301
00:21:01,345 --> 00:21:03,025
My Lady, be careful.

302
00:21:06,065 --> 00:21:07,345
Father.

303
00:21:07,425 --> 00:21:10,225
The carriage that took them
out of town is back.

304
00:21:10,305 --> 00:21:11,585
Shall we make early preparations?

305
00:21:11,665 --> 00:21:14,585
If Mr. Xie really
finds out something, then…

306
00:21:14,665 --> 00:21:17,505
Jiang did something reckless.

307
00:21:17,585 --> 00:21:20,945
But since we promised to help,
we won't complain.

308
00:21:26,705 --> 00:21:30,785
Between the Grand Princess
and Mr. Xie, there will be

309
00:21:33,225 --> 00:21:35,385
a long game of strategy.

310
00:21:35,465 --> 00:21:37,585
XIE RESIDENCE

311
00:21:37,665 --> 00:21:39,625
Welcome, Mr. Deng.

312
00:21:39,705 --> 00:21:41,385
We are honored by your presence.

313
00:21:48,985 --> 00:21:50,545
This orchid is very delicate.

314
00:21:51,665 --> 00:21:53,105
No strangers shall touch it.

315
00:21:53,705 --> 00:21:55,545
You tend this flower so well.

316
00:21:56,145 --> 00:21:59,105
Sadly, its roots have rotted.

317
00:22:00,065 --> 00:22:01,745
It barely appears to bloom.

318
00:22:03,225 --> 00:22:04,745
You've searched the whole day.

319
00:22:05,585 --> 00:22:06,825
Have you found what you're after?

320
00:22:12,985 --> 00:22:15,265
The Grand Princess is so far away,

321
00:22:15,785 --> 00:22:18,185
but big clans give her generous support.

322
00:22:19,065 --> 00:22:21,265
She does have great influence.

323
00:22:22,105 --> 00:22:25,665
You didn't come here
just to satirize me, did you?

324
00:22:26,585 --> 00:22:28,745
Do you know where Chu Zhao is?

325
00:22:29,785 --> 00:22:32,585
She's riding at full speed toward Xiaonan.

326
00:22:32,665 --> 00:22:36,665
Does she think Xiao Xun
will retreat when his father is trapped?

327
00:22:38,785 --> 00:22:39,945
How childish.

328
00:22:40,545 --> 00:22:42,905
Her Highness will suppress the rebels
on His Majesty's behalf.

329
00:22:43,745 --> 00:22:44,705
What's wrong with it?

330
00:22:45,865 --> 00:22:47,585
Her Highness has great influence.

331
00:22:47,665 --> 00:22:50,825
Since she dares,
she must be confident enough.

332
00:22:51,425 --> 00:22:52,345
Yeah.

333
00:22:53,025 --> 00:22:55,185
You and Her Highness
used to have the same goal.

334
00:22:55,265 --> 00:22:57,105
You were both against Xiao Xun.

335
00:22:57,705 --> 00:23:00,825
But you insist on using
Chu Lan as a scapegoat

336
00:23:00,905 --> 00:23:03,305
and getting her clan involved.

337
00:23:04,345 --> 00:23:05,305
Obviously,

338
00:23:06,465 --> 00:23:08,265
Chu Zhao wouldn't agree.

339
00:23:08,345 --> 00:23:10,305
That's a bit much, Mr. Deng.

340
00:23:11,825 --> 00:23:13,665
As long as you approve the edict

341
00:23:13,745 --> 00:23:17,945
that Xiao Xun instigated Chu Lan
to poison the imperial grandson,

342
00:23:18,745 --> 00:23:21,145
Her Highness will be
suppressing the rebels

343
00:23:21,225 --> 00:23:22,425
with a valid reason.

344
00:23:23,105 --> 00:23:26,065
I'm helping her, aren't I?

345
00:23:29,105 --> 00:23:31,305
Have you heard about this?

346
00:23:31,385 --> 00:23:35,105
An orchid dies,
but its fragrance will linger.

347
00:23:35,185 --> 00:23:36,745
Someone

348
00:23:38,265 --> 00:23:40,225
only gets in the way when he's alive.

349
00:23:41,665 --> 00:23:43,545
Mr. Xie, you have

350
00:23:43,625 --> 00:23:45,305
a very clever plan.

351
00:23:47,465 --> 00:23:48,745
I'll take my leave.

352
00:23:52,785 --> 00:23:53,905
Mr. Deng.

353
00:23:56,025 --> 00:23:57,585
We're just serving the state

354
00:23:58,105 --> 00:23:59,825
by cutting out the deadwood.

355
00:24:12,345 --> 00:24:13,425
‎EDICT TO DEPOSE THE RENEGADE OFFICIAL

356
00:24:13,505 --> 00:24:14,465
What's this?

357
00:24:14,545 --> 00:24:16,265
Why is Zhao guilty?

358
00:24:18,465 --> 00:24:19,345
Don't, Your Majesty.

359
00:24:32,185 --> 00:24:33,025
Your Majesty,

360
00:24:34,225 --> 00:24:35,225
this edict says

361
00:24:35,305 --> 00:24:38,585
her uncle Chu Lan is guilty.
Did you forget?

362
00:24:39,265 --> 00:24:40,865
He tried to poison you back then.

363
00:24:40,945 --> 00:24:43,745
So, Her Highness
took you away from her family.

364
00:24:44,265 --> 00:24:45,865
So, Chu Lan is really guilty.

365
00:24:47,665 --> 00:24:49,465
Then why did no one tell me about it?

366
00:24:50,225 --> 00:24:52,265
Chu Lan is Zhao's uncle.

367
00:24:52,345 --> 00:24:55,345
If he's guilty, she will be implicated.

368
00:24:56,185 --> 00:24:57,865
Now, the situation is complicated.

369
00:24:58,705 --> 00:25:00,865
Lord of Xiaonan and his heir
intend rebellion.

370
00:25:00,945 --> 00:25:03,105
Xiao Xun is coming as a defender.

371
00:25:03,625 --> 00:25:05,105
Our people support him.

372
00:25:05,625 --> 00:25:07,505
Ministers want the city gate
to be opened too.

373
00:25:08,265 --> 00:25:10,385
But if he leads
his 100,000 troops into town

374
00:25:10,465 --> 00:25:12,545
without firing a single shot,

375
00:25:13,465 --> 00:25:14,625
we won't be able to resist.

376
00:25:15,225 --> 00:25:16,705
The casualties will be terrible.

377
00:25:18,265 --> 00:25:19,785
What we should do now

378
00:25:20,305 --> 00:25:24,265
is let the entire world know
the sins of Xiao Xun and his father.

379
00:25:25,025 --> 00:25:26,425
Then we'll all rise against them.

380
00:25:29,545 --> 00:25:30,865
You're bullying Zhao.

381
00:25:31,465 --> 00:25:34,705
You're bullying her
just because her father is gone.

382
00:25:38,945 --> 00:25:39,945
Yu,

383
00:25:42,185 --> 00:25:44,145
no one is bullying your sister.

384
00:25:44,745 --> 00:25:46,105
If she were here now,

385
00:25:47,385 --> 00:25:48,745
she would do the same.

386
00:25:53,665 --> 00:25:55,905
The post houses have been cut off.

387
00:25:55,985 --> 00:25:57,985
But the men I sent out learnt something.

388
00:25:58,065 --> 00:26:00,745
Xiao Xun intercepted a victory report.

389
00:26:00,825 --> 00:26:02,385
Not long ago,

390
00:26:02,465 --> 00:26:05,505
Chu Zhao led a raid
against Northern Desert Royal Army,

391
00:26:05,585 --> 00:26:06,865
driving them back a hundred li.

392
00:26:08,625 --> 00:26:09,505
And later,

393
00:26:10,265 --> 00:26:12,305
the enemy relaunched an attack.

394
00:26:12,385 --> 00:26:15,305
Once again, she led troops to crush them.

395
00:26:16,225 --> 00:26:17,265
She did?

396
00:26:18,865 --> 00:26:19,705
What's more,

397
00:26:20,225 --> 00:26:23,025
on hearing Xiao Xun was leading troops
to surround the Capital,

398
00:26:23,105 --> 00:26:25,945
she led forces to attack Xiaonan.

399
00:26:26,505 --> 00:26:27,545
Do you know why?

400
00:26:28,745 --> 00:26:30,465
"Besiege Wei to rescue Zhao."
I've read about that.

401
00:26:32,185 --> 00:26:33,145
That's right.

402
00:26:34,425 --> 00:26:35,665
So you don't need to worry.

403
00:26:36,345 --> 00:26:38,585
Your sister fears nothing.

404
00:26:39,185 --> 00:26:40,705
No one can bully her easily.

405
00:26:41,385 --> 00:26:43,665
She's defending our state and our people.

406
00:26:44,305 --> 00:26:47,865
Even when her uncle is guilty,
she won't be implicated.

407
00:26:49,505 --> 00:26:50,585
Do you trust me?

408
00:26:51,865 --> 00:26:52,705
I trust you.

409
00:27:05,705 --> 00:27:07,865
CHU LAN PLOTTED REGICIDE WITH XIAO XUN.
TITLES REVOKED. ASSETS SEIZED. IMPRISONED.

410
00:27:17,505 --> 00:27:20,465
XIAONAN PREFECTURE

411
00:27:26,185 --> 00:27:27,025
I never thought

412
00:27:28,465 --> 00:27:31,825
I could have a battle
against the Grand Princess.

413
00:27:32,345 --> 00:27:35,465
How dare she besiege us
with only a few thousand troops?

414
00:27:36,065 --> 00:27:37,425
A warrior's daughter?

415
00:27:37,505 --> 00:27:41,065
I think the great reputation of Chu Ling

416
00:27:41,145 --> 00:27:44,785
will just be ruined by his daughter
who has a swollen head.

417
00:27:45,625 --> 00:27:47,425
Your Lordship, don't bother with her.

418
00:27:47,505 --> 00:27:48,985
I'll go teach her a lesson.

419
00:27:51,305 --> 00:27:53,705
Your Lordship, the Grand Princess
wants to talk.

420
00:27:53,785 --> 00:27:55,905
The Grand Princess? What's she doing here?

421
00:27:57,505 --> 00:27:59,025
Since she wants to talk,

422
00:27:59,545 --> 00:28:02,825
tell her I have trouble walking
and can't go out.

423
00:28:03,585 --> 00:28:06,825
However, my gate is always open to her.

424
00:28:07,545 --> 00:28:09,185
She can come anytime.

425
00:28:09,705 --> 00:28:11,505
XIAONAN

426
00:28:11,585 --> 00:28:13,585
We both know it's an ambush.

427
00:28:14,585 --> 00:28:15,985
If you enter his mansion,

428
00:28:16,065 --> 00:28:17,145
you'll be walking
straight into the lion's den.

429
00:28:17,905 --> 00:28:20,225
If Xiaonan holds you as a hostage,

430
00:28:20,825 --> 00:28:22,265
the Capital will face a tough choice.

431
00:28:22,785 --> 00:28:23,625
You worry too much.

432
00:28:24,345 --> 00:28:27,425
Mr. Deng and Xie Yanfang
can't wait for me to die for the state.

433
00:28:28,265 --> 00:28:31,505
Believe it or not,
they've even prepared my posthumous title.

434
00:28:32,305 --> 00:28:33,585
This is no child's play.

435
00:28:34,345 --> 00:28:35,345
Are you really sure?

436
00:28:35,865 --> 00:28:36,985
I know what worries you.

437
00:28:37,065 --> 00:28:39,345
The Lord of Xiaonan is so cunning

438
00:28:39,425 --> 00:28:41,745
that he even rebels
in the name of guarding His Majesty.

439
00:28:42,985 --> 00:28:45,265
If the Grand Princess dies in his mansion,

440
00:28:45,865 --> 00:28:47,665
guess how history will judge him.

441
00:28:48,305 --> 00:28:51,585
He will be a traitor,
whether he likes it or not.

442
00:28:52,265 --> 00:28:53,145
So…

443
00:28:56,305 --> 00:28:59,225
Will you take this gamble with me?

444
00:29:01,385 --> 00:29:02,225
Of course.

445
00:29:02,305 --> 00:29:04,065
Not to mention his mansion,

446
00:29:04,145 --> 00:29:06,385
I'll even follow you

447
00:29:07,265 --> 00:29:08,105
to the underworld.

448
00:29:12,665 --> 00:29:13,505
This time,

449
00:29:15,985 --> 00:29:17,225
we'll all live well.

450
00:29:21,025 --> 00:29:22,225
We must live.

451
00:30:03,265 --> 00:30:06,145
XIAONAN

452
00:30:09,105 --> 00:30:10,625
What an impressive mansion.

453
00:30:11,225 --> 00:30:12,345
Look at the scale.

454
00:30:12,425 --> 00:30:15,985
He's so obviously showing
his ambition to be the Emperor.

455
00:30:17,185 --> 00:30:20,785
Then, I'll kill that hope of his.

456
00:30:47,465 --> 00:30:48,945
<i>WEILIAOZI: ON MILITARY STRATEGY</i>

457
00:31:15,865 --> 00:31:18,065
How could we reject the tea he offered?

458
00:31:19,865 --> 00:31:21,985
You've got some spine, Miss Chu.

459
00:31:23,345 --> 00:31:26,545
Don't you fear I may put something
in the tea?

460
00:31:27,065 --> 00:31:29,945
I am the Grand Princess of State.

461
00:31:31,345 --> 00:31:34,025
I can fight battles with you
and slaughter your men.

462
00:31:35,465 --> 00:31:37,545
If I were to die from poisoned tea,

463
00:31:38,065 --> 00:31:40,905
people in the world would laugh at you.

464
00:31:45,545 --> 00:31:47,145
Even if I were bloodthirsty,

465
00:31:47,225 --> 00:31:49,345
I would know I should keep
worthy generals alive.

466
00:31:50,305 --> 00:31:53,025
Besides, I've admired General Chu.

467
00:31:53,665 --> 00:31:54,865
He's gone.

468
00:31:54,945 --> 00:31:57,905
I still count on you
to inherit his legacy.

469
00:31:58,425 --> 00:31:59,665
How would I try to kill you?

470
00:32:00,265 --> 00:32:01,545
You flatter me.

471
00:32:03,705 --> 00:32:04,785
In that case,

472
00:32:05,305 --> 00:32:08,105
please withdraw your troops
that are besieging the Capital.

473
00:32:09,985 --> 00:32:13,345
Don't let common folks die
in your fight for the throne.

474
00:32:14,745 --> 00:32:16,625
As a general's daughter,

475
00:32:17,465 --> 00:32:19,505
you must be familiar
with military classics.

476
00:32:22,345 --> 00:32:25,505
Have you read about this?
Glory for one, death for thousands.

477
00:32:26,705 --> 00:32:28,705
New dynasty rises, the old one falls.

478
00:32:28,785 --> 00:32:32,625
Someone must sweep away the incense ash

479
00:32:33,145 --> 00:32:34,625
before burning new incense.

480
00:32:35,225 --> 00:32:38,545
If His Majesty grants you the Golden Seal

481
00:32:39,425 --> 00:32:41,025
and feudal sovereignty,

482
00:32:42,345 --> 00:32:43,505
will you stop the war?

483
00:32:44,985 --> 00:32:48,905
Your Highness, when His Lordship
can get the Imperial Seal,

484
00:32:48,985 --> 00:32:50,985
why would he need the Golden Seal?

485
00:32:53,585 --> 00:32:56,865
You offered a great deal
to make me retreat.

486
00:32:57,465 --> 00:33:01,505
But how dare a woman like you
grant me feudal sovereignty?

487
00:33:02,745 --> 00:33:05,025
When I grant something, you will get it.

488
00:33:13,625 --> 00:33:15,385
Now, I understand.

489
00:33:15,465 --> 00:33:17,425
You aren't persuading me

490
00:33:17,505 --> 00:33:20,905
for the young emperor
or the ministers in the court.

491
00:33:22,105 --> 00:33:25,345
You're trying to stop me
for the sake of the people.

492
00:33:27,785 --> 00:33:29,625
What a saint you are.

493
00:33:31,345 --> 00:33:32,905
I'm not a saint.

494
00:33:35,345 --> 00:33:38,025
I am the Grand Princess of State.

495
00:33:38,625 --> 00:33:40,665
I won't see this state fall apart.

496
00:33:41,985 --> 00:33:43,505
Like I said,

497
00:33:43,585 --> 00:33:46,625
I've admired General Chu,
and I think highly of you.

498
00:33:48,025 --> 00:33:48,985
What about

499
00:33:50,545 --> 00:33:53,145
you and I working together?

500
00:33:58,625 --> 00:33:59,465
How?

501
00:34:00,945 --> 00:34:04,265
If I become the Emperor,
Xun will be the Crown Prince,

502
00:34:04,345 --> 00:34:05,745
and you'll be the Crown Princess.

503
00:34:06,345 --> 00:34:08,065
Then you'll be the Empress.

504
00:34:09,185 --> 00:34:10,264
I can also grant you

505
00:34:10,344 --> 00:34:14,465
the command over frontier troops,
unrestrained by the court's Tally.

506
00:34:15,744 --> 00:34:16,665
Do you agree?

507
00:34:22,585 --> 00:34:24,625
So, being Xiao Xun's empress

508
00:34:25,665 --> 00:34:27,425
can get me such great power.

509
00:34:27,505 --> 00:34:29,264
I'm not kidding.

510
00:34:29,985 --> 00:34:30,985
I know.

511
00:34:32,185 --> 00:34:34,425
You really mean it.

512
00:34:35,304 --> 00:34:36,304
Too bad, though.

513
00:34:37,344 --> 00:34:38,744
Am I offering not enough?

514
00:34:38,824 --> 00:34:41,185
Feel free to make any other requests.

515
00:34:41,985 --> 00:34:43,744
I have only one request.

516
00:34:44,505 --> 00:34:46,945
I request you to stop the war.

517
00:34:51,625 --> 00:34:53,585
You need to understand one thing.

518
00:34:54,705 --> 00:34:56,545
I can persuade you.

519
00:34:56,625 --> 00:34:58,825
You're in no position to persuade me.

520
00:34:59,665 --> 00:35:01,505
I'm not here to persuade you,

521
00:35:02,385 --> 00:35:03,785
but threaten you.

522
00:35:06,905 --> 00:35:08,945
With what can you threaten me?

523
00:35:11,185 --> 00:35:12,105
Xiao Xun.

524
00:35:25,385 --> 00:35:27,105
Speaking of him,

525
00:35:27,705 --> 00:35:30,265
he has still kept your birthdate card.

526
00:35:31,025 --> 00:35:34,785
He knelt for three days and nights,
swearing to marry no one but you.

527
00:35:35,385 --> 00:35:37,785
But you requested
to annul your engagement.

528
00:35:38,545 --> 00:35:42,505
Xun still hasn't figured out
what he did wrong.

529
00:35:43,665 --> 00:35:44,865
Today,

530
00:35:45,825 --> 00:35:47,905
I know the answer.

531
00:35:53,025 --> 00:35:55,105
You must be Commander Xie.

532
00:35:56,905 --> 00:35:59,025
I've heard a lot about you.

533
00:35:59,105 --> 00:36:00,945
You're as remarkable as people say.

534
00:36:02,265 --> 00:36:03,425
During the coup,

535
00:36:03,505 --> 00:36:06,425
you led a few guards
to defeat ten thousand troops.

536
00:36:06,505 --> 00:36:07,705
You are a real hero.

537
00:36:09,785 --> 00:36:12,225
Your Lordship, don't be ridiculous.

538
00:36:12,745 --> 00:36:16,585
I broke off my engagement
for the people of our state,

539
00:36:17,105 --> 00:36:19,025
not for romance.

540
00:36:20,825 --> 00:36:22,825
Narrow-minded as you are,

541
00:36:23,345 --> 00:36:24,625
how can you fight for the throne?

542
00:36:26,305 --> 00:36:27,865
What a sharp tongue.

543
00:36:28,865 --> 00:36:30,865
If I remember correctly, Mr. Xie,

544
00:36:31,385 --> 00:36:34,945
your brother also has great ambitions.

545
00:36:35,585 --> 00:36:38,985
If one day you meet in armed conflict,
whose side will you take?

546
00:36:42,265 --> 00:36:45,105
I pledge loyalty to His Majesty,
the Grand Princess,

547
00:36:45,905 --> 00:36:47,345
and the State of Chu.

548
00:36:47,865 --> 00:36:51,385
Anyone who hurts the imperial heir
or the Grand Princess

549
00:37:01,785 --> 00:37:03,585
will be my enemy.

550
00:37:04,305 --> 00:37:06,705
You're truly a hero
who is worth a hundred men.

551
00:37:08,225 --> 00:37:09,705
Remarkable, indeed.

552
00:37:11,985 --> 00:37:16,065
Do you know he isn't the only one
who is worth a hundred?

553
00:37:17,585 --> 00:37:18,705
There's also the Longwei Army.

554
00:37:21,185 --> 00:37:22,465
The Longwei Army?

555
00:37:22,545 --> 00:37:24,905
You must've heard about the Longwei Army.

556
00:37:25,545 --> 00:37:28,825
They put down the rebellion
while outnumbered.

557
00:37:29,465 --> 00:37:31,665
My father devotedly trained them.

558
00:37:31,745 --> 00:37:35,825
They move like ghosts
and scatter around in disguise.

559
00:37:36,625 --> 00:37:39,905
How can you be sure
there aren't any in your mansion?

560
00:37:45,505 --> 00:37:47,505
If you agree to retreat,

561
00:37:48,905 --> 00:37:50,025
I'll pretend nothing happened.

562
00:37:50,905 --> 00:37:52,865
So, this is how you threaten me.

563
00:37:54,145 --> 00:37:59,025
You want to use the Longwei Army
to kill my son as well as me.

564
00:37:59,105 --> 00:38:02,145
You can take this as a gamble.

565
00:38:03,065 --> 00:38:04,425
Five thousand soldiers outside the town.

566
00:38:05,105 --> 00:38:07,025
Five thousand of the Longwei Army in town.

567
00:38:07,545 --> 00:38:10,785
If they join hands,

568
00:38:12,065 --> 00:38:13,585
how will you handle it?

569
00:38:19,625 --> 00:38:20,625
Someone.

570
00:38:21,145 --> 00:38:24,105
Get the rooms ready.
Give Her Highness a warm reception.

571
00:38:31,585 --> 00:38:33,025
The secret guards in this room
can be withdrawn.

572
00:38:35,225 --> 00:38:38,065
With poor inner power and uneven breath,

573
00:38:39,425 --> 00:38:40,345
they're useless.

574
00:38:46,225 --> 00:38:49,745
Your Lordship, Xie Yanlai
is no ordinary man.

575
00:38:49,825 --> 00:38:52,345
When he's around Chu Zhao,
we can hardly hurt her.

576
00:38:53,545 --> 00:38:55,585
Ning Kun, you have no idea.

577
00:38:56,385 --> 00:38:58,705
Chu Ling and the late emperor
trained the Longwei Army.

578
00:38:59,705 --> 00:39:02,425
The scariest thing about them is,

579
00:39:02,505 --> 00:39:04,505
we don't know who they are,

580
00:39:04,585 --> 00:39:06,905
and we don't know
when or where they'll appear.

581
00:39:08,225 --> 00:39:09,985
They're unpreventable.

582
00:39:10,745 --> 00:39:12,705
Tell Xun to be on guard.

583
00:39:13,225 --> 00:39:14,145
Yes.

584
00:39:19,585 --> 00:39:20,585
In such a big courtyard,

585
00:39:21,385 --> 00:39:22,865
I can't even hear a bird.

586
00:39:23,705 --> 00:39:25,065
It's eerily quiet.

587
00:39:30,265 --> 00:39:31,105
Careful.

588
00:39:34,225 --> 00:39:36,145
Lord of Xiaonan has great taste.

589
00:39:36,225 --> 00:39:39,905
He even uses the best tea
for mere visitors.

590
00:39:40,505 --> 00:39:42,705
Too bad, though. The tea got cold.

591
00:39:42,785 --> 00:39:44,265
We know it's an ambush,

592
00:39:44,945 --> 00:39:46,505
and we should be more cautious.

593
00:39:46,585 --> 00:39:47,945
What if he poisoned the tea?

594
00:39:48,025 --> 00:39:49,065
He wouldn't dare.

595
00:39:50,305 --> 00:39:51,505
Not now, at least.

596
00:39:52,105 --> 00:39:54,225
What he wants is to be legitimate.

597
00:39:54,945 --> 00:39:58,025
If I die in his place, have a guess.

598
00:39:58,545 --> 00:40:01,025
Will people spit and drown this place?

599
00:40:07,785 --> 00:40:11,505
You know the Longwei Army
isn't in Xiaonan,

600
00:40:11,585 --> 00:40:13,585
but you bluffed just like that.

601
00:40:14,905 --> 00:40:16,665
Didn't you fear that he could
see through you?

602
00:40:17,305 --> 00:40:18,465
Let me tell you this.

603
00:40:18,545 --> 00:40:20,305
What makes the Longwei Army terrifying

604
00:40:20,385 --> 00:40:22,985
is that people believe they're everywhere.

605
00:40:30,745 --> 00:40:31,905
Don't worry.

606
00:40:32,465 --> 00:40:35,025
Someone's having a harder time.

607
00:40:35,545 --> 00:40:36,905
His Lordship is cautious by nature.

608
00:40:36,985 --> 00:40:40,065
Without a perfect plan,
he wouldn't act rashly.

609
00:40:40,145 --> 00:40:43,825
He sent Xiao Xun to the Capital
because he thought the time was right.

610
00:40:45,225 --> 00:40:46,985
The calmer we are,

611
00:40:47,585 --> 00:40:50,745
the more he will doubt his own judgment.

612
00:40:51,465 --> 00:40:53,345
When he thinks it's not the right time,

613
00:40:54,745 --> 00:40:56,105
he'll ask Xiao Xun to retreat.

614
00:40:56,705 --> 00:40:58,625
So, just now, you were trying

615
00:40:59,745 --> 00:41:00,945
to break his will,

616
00:41:01,865 --> 00:41:04,225
making him think his plan wasn't perfect.

617
00:41:04,305 --> 00:41:06,265
Then he'll lose his cool

618
00:41:06,345 --> 00:41:07,865
-and withdraw.
-That's right.

619
00:41:07,945 --> 00:41:11,905
So, Jiu, don't be impatient.
We'll just wait.

620
00:41:13,065 --> 00:41:14,465
We'll wait patiently

621
00:41:15,705 --> 00:41:17,025
until he makes his decision.

622
00:41:18,065 --> 00:41:21,305
I've heard this is the best scenic spot
all over this mansion.

623
00:41:22,825 --> 00:41:25,745
Let's not waste his hospitality.

